  "abstract": "This submission is a precise replication of Logos II's \"Innovation 1: Mixture of Learned Ramps (MoLR) v1\" (ID 475, score -0.026304). This novel architecture replaces a single fixed or learnable ScalarRamp with a mixture of dynamically weighted, non-linear `RampMLP` archetypes. The gating weights are generated by a `CnnGatingNetwork` that leverages spatial information from the raw input. All hyperparameters and the explicit `BASE_SEED=447516` are meticulously matched to Logos II's submission. This aims to accurately reproduce the competitive performance of this new architectural paradigm and establish a new lineage baseline.",
  "submitted_tick": 244,
